' Asisten / PJ Proker — update progress proker yang ditugaskan, ikut kegiatan
AS --> P01
AS --> P02
AS --> P12
AS --> P13
AS --> P16
AS --> P17
AS --> K01
AS --> K02
AS --> K03
AS --> K04
AS --> K08
AS --> K10
AS --> K11
AS --> K12
AS --> K13
AS --> K16

' Dosen — approve kegiatan
DS --> P01
DS --> P02
DS --> K01
DS --> K02
DS --> K06
DS --> K07
DS --> K16

' ============================================================
' RELASI ANTAR USE CASE
' ============================================================

' Proker — include / extend
P03 ..> P07 : <<extend>>
P07 ..> P08 : <<extend>>
P07 ..> P09 : <<extend>>
P08 ..> P18 : <<extend>>
P10 ..> P12 : <<extend>>
P12 ..> P13 : <<extend>>

' Kegiatan — include / extend
K03 ..> K01 : <<include>>
K06 ..> K08 : <<extend>>
K15 ..> K14 : <<include>>

note bottom of P08
  Proker perlu disetujui (status_pengajuan = disetujui)
  sebelum update progress (capaian / evaluasi / dokumentasi)
  dapat dilakukan.
end note

note bottom of K06
  Kegiatan diajukan dulu (status_approval = diajukan)
  sebelum bisa disetujui / ditolak oleh Approver.
end note

@enduml
